1
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,640
[EP21]

2
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:41,800
Last night,

3
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:44,760
you weren't afraid that she would really choose the first option,

4
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:45,960
marry into the Ling family,

5
00:00:46,480 --> 00:00:47,680
and do something else against you?

6
00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:48,920
The things she did before

7
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:50,300
were because she had no choice.

8
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:51,900
Now that I've given her a choice,

9
00:00:52,620 --> 00:00:53,920
she won't take that old path.

10
00:00:55,220 --> 00:00:55,580
Yes,

11
00:00:57,080 --> 00:00:58,500
people always need to have choices.

12
00:00:59,720 --> 00:01:00,520
But my parents,

13
00:01:01,860 --> 00:01:02,740
they didn't have a choice.

14
00:01:04,860 --> 00:01:05,740
They were

15
00:01:05,740 --> 00:01:07,060
arranged by feudal society.

16
00:01:08,140 --> 00:01:09,400
They hated each other all their lives,

17
00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:11,500
and even

18
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:13,660
didn't like me very much.

19
00:01:14,940 --> 00:01:15,600
They...

20
00:01:17,080 --> 00:01:17,860
weren't good to you?

21
00:01:18,660 --> 00:01:20,000
I don't have much of an impression

22
00:01:20,860 --> 00:01:21,820
of my mother.

23
00:01:22,880 --> 00:01:23,780
I only remember

24
00:01:25,340 --> 00:01:25,980
when I was a child,

25
00:01:25,980 --> 00:01:27,100
every time I greeted her,

26
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:29,120
she just walked away.

27
00:01:33,180 --> 00:01:33,720
Mother,

28
00:01:33,720 --> 00:01:35,420
I come to greet you.

29
00:01:46,140 --> 00:01:47,980
Mom, why do you ignore me?

30
00:01:51,160 --> 00:01:52,720
Why don't you like me?

31
00:01:53,140 --> 00:01:54,240
I've done everything

32
00:01:54,240 --> 00:01:56,100
Grandma told me to do.

33
00:02:05,900 --> 00:02:06,560
What about Commander Ling?

34
00:02:07,740 --> 00:02:08,820
My father

35
00:02:08,920 --> 00:02:10,540
always shows tenderness to others,

36
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:13,900
but only scolds me.

37
00:02:14,860 --> 00:02:16,160
He never asked me

38
00:02:16,220 --> 00:02:17,180
what I really wanted.

39
00:02:19,040 --> 00:02:20,260
You're so young and you don't learn well.

40
00:02:20,760 --> 00:02:22,300
Can you take things from the pond?

41
00:02:22,720 --> 00:02:23,740
Are you listening to me?

42
00:02:24,080 --> 00:02:25,500
You still do such bad things.

43
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:27,020
What should I do in the future?

44
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:29,100
How can you inherit the family business?

45
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:30,820
How can I teach you?

46
00:02:31,100 --> 00:02:32,060
Still not talking?

47
00:02:32,460 --> 00:02:33,420
Second Uncle, Second Uncle.

48
00:02:34,060 --> 00:02:35,320
Look at the windmill.

49
00:02:38,220 --> 00:02:38,800
Okay.

50
00:02:39,100 --> 00:02:39,620
You blow on it.

51
00:02:39,620 --> 00:02:40,040
Let me blow on it.

52
00:02:42,460 --> 00:02:43,860
Xueqiu is really well-behaved.

53
00:02:47,580 --> 00:02:48,380
Grandma.

54
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:50,660
Grandma told me when I was little

55
00:02:50,860 --> 00:02:51,740
I was born

56
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:53,860
to repay the Ye Family's debts.

57
00:02:55,160 --> 00:02:55,720
Affection

58
00:02:56,640 --> 00:02:58,480
is the most useless thing in the world.

59
00:02:59,340 --> 00:03:00,280
Ling Shenxing,

60
00:03:00,980 --> 00:03:01,740
do you know?

61
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:03,860
Your existence

62
00:03:04,760 --> 00:03:06,040
is for the Ye Family.

63
00:03:06,740 --> 00:03:07,720
Why are you looking at me?

64
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:08,920
Did you hear what I said?

65
00:03:09,640 --> 00:03:10,360
Stand still.

66
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:14,660
I'll make you remember!

67
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:15,880
Hands out!

68
00:03:16,440 --> 00:03:17,500
I remember!

69
00:03:17,600 --> 00:03:19,460
Can you stop beating me?

70
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:21,400
Hands out!

71
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:22,360
Don't move!

72
00:03:26,260 --> 00:03:27,160
Ling Shenxing,

73
00:03:27,580 --> 00:03:29,300
today, I'll make you remember

74
00:03:29,740 --> 00:03:30,860
your mission

75
00:03:31,180 --> 00:03:31,900
is to lead

76
00:03:31,900 --> 00:03:33,600
the Ling and Ye families forward!

77
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:35,900
In this world,

78
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:38,340
no one loves you.

79
00:03:38,940 --> 00:03:40,160
No one loves you.

80
00:03:40,160 --> 00:03:40,820
Do you know that?

81
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:42,040
Don't cry.

82
00:03:45,340 --> 00:03:46,660
You must be strong.

83
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:49,080
You must be successful.

84
00:03:50,700 --> 00:03:51,560
Do you know that?

85
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:53,200
You must support

86
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:54,520
the Ling and Ye families.

87
00:03:55,260 --> 00:03:57,240
You must understand.

88
00:03:57,640 --> 00:03:58,540
Do you understand?

89
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:06,700
Don't be sad.

90
00:04:07,200 --> 00:04:07,840
You still have me.

91
00:04:10,780 --> 00:04:12,220
Don't think about

92
00:04:12,740 --> 00:04:13,500
those unhappy things.

93
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:18,600
Being a parent doesn't require a test.

94
00:04:19,140 --> 00:04:20,080
Not all parents

95
00:04:20,080 --> 00:04:21,320
are born to be parents.

96
00:04:22,100 --> 00:04:23,240
Accepting that they won't love you

97
00:04:23,620 --> 00:04:24,220
is harder

98
00:04:24,220 --> 00:04:25,240
than

99
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:25,660
loving them.

100
00:04:27,760 --> 00:04:29,380
Do you remember the Qiqiao Festival?

101
00:04:29,740 --> 00:04:31,440
When I went back to find the plaque,

102
00:04:31,680 --> 00:04:32,300
I found

103
00:04:32,380 --> 00:04:33,380
so many plaques with your name on it.

104
00:04:34,320 --> 00:04:36,060
Some are from the people of Yang City,

105
00:04:36,200 --> 00:04:37,300
and some are from the soldiers.

106
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:50,740
Your parents may not know how to love you,

107
00:04:51,880 --> 00:04:53,060
but the people of Yang City love you.

108
00:04:53,900 --> 00:04:54,460
I love you too.

109
00:04:57,220 --> 00:04:57,800
You have me.

110
00:05:02,140 --> 00:05:02,740
Fortunately,

111
00:05:03,020 --> 00:05:03,600
I have you.

112
00:05:14,140 --> 00:05:14,600
Thank you.

113
00:05:16,080 --> 00:05:16,600
You're welcome.

114
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:23,380
Abao should

115
00:05:23,380 --> 00:05:24,580
wake up soon.

116
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:52,180
What's going on?

117
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:56,540
The Young Marshal planned to take me away,

118
00:05:57,180 --> 00:05:58,200
but he ran into Young Master Chu.

119
00:05:58,820 --> 00:05:59,840
He was afraid of alarming them,

120
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,260
so he detained me for two more days.

121
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:03,460
He found a prisoner with a similar figure

122
00:06:03,540 --> 00:06:04,580
to make a substitute.

123
00:06:06,500 --> 00:06:06,880
By the way,

124
00:06:07,900 --> 00:06:08,800
before I fell into the well,

125
00:06:09,180 --> 00:06:10,720
did I say anything unusual?

126
00:06:10,900 --> 00:06:11,300
Or

127
00:06:12,260 --> 00:06:13,760
mention anyone suspicious?

128
00:06:15,180 --> 00:06:16,820
You scolded Old Madam Ling.

129
00:06:17,080 --> 00:06:17,800
Miss Ye.

130
00:06:18,300 --> 00:06:19,280
And you said Second Concubine

131
00:06:19,280 --> 00:06:20,840
cried on a stranger's shoulder,

132
00:06:21,400 --> 00:06:23,300
fearing it would ruin the family's reputation.

133
00:06:23,840 --> 00:06:24,400
What's

134
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:25,200
her surname?

135
00:06:25,540 --> 00:06:26,540
Shen.

136
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:28,180
Her family controls

137
00:06:28,180 --> 00:06:29,280
all the water sources in Yang City.

138
00:06:29,900 --> 00:06:31,020
You also mentioned

139
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:32,240
that the Ling family

140
00:06:32,460 --> 00:06:33,760
rely on Shen Family

141
00:06:33,880 --> 00:06:35,060
for water supply.

142
00:06:36,900 --> 00:06:37,560
Yang City?

143
00:06:38,380 --> 00:06:38,980
Water source?

144
00:06:39,540 --> 00:06:40,800
[News!]

145
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:41,880
[News!]

146
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:43,680
[Yang City is hit by plague.]

147
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:45,220
[Ling Shao Shuai is unfilial,]

148
00:06:45,220 --> 00:06:46,340
[and deserves divine punishment.]

149
00:06:46,880 --> 00:06:48,000
Get out!

150
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:49,520
Get out!

151
00:06:52,460 --> 00:06:54,040
Ling Shenxing, come out!

152
00:06:59,160 --> 00:07:00,080
How can you be so unreasonable?

153
00:07:02,180 --> 00:07:03,000
The plague is rampant.

154
00:07:03,280 --> 00:07:04,500
It's the Ling residence that has been treating you,

155
00:07:04,500 --> 00:07:05,220
and delivering medicine to you.

156
00:07:06,180 --> 00:07:07,460
How can you believe the rumors so easily?

157
00:07:07,840 --> 00:07:08,400
Bah!

158
00:07:08,740 --> 00:07:09,680
The newspaper has written it.

159
00:07:10,080 --> 00:07:11,120
The disaster was brought by you.

160
00:07:11,960 --> 00:07:13,280
Can the Ling residence be irresponsible?

161
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:14,980
The newspapers in Yang City are all controlled by Chu Nanfeng.

162
00:07:15,660 --> 00:07:17,000
He's trying to bring down Ling Shenxing,

163
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:17,720
so he spread the rumors.

164
00:07:18,300 --> 00:07:19,080
I have to go find him.

165
00:07:21,760 --> 00:07:22,420
Chu Nanfeng,

166
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:24,380
did you spread the rumors?

167
00:07:24,900 --> 00:07:26,060
Did you cause the plague?

168
00:07:33,260 --> 00:07:34,720
You're only half right.

169
00:07:36,940 --> 00:07:37,900
You taught me that.

170
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:39,220
Did you forget?

171
00:07:40,300 --> 00:07:41,760
See that dancing man?

172
00:07:42,020 --> 00:07:42,660
That's my father.

173
00:07:43,180 --> 00:07:43,800
Look at him.

174
00:07:44,200 --> 00:07:45,000
He's so happy.

175
00:07:50,340 --> 00:07:52,140
My stepmother was my mother's maid.

176
00:07:53,200 --> 00:07:54,700
When my mother was pregnant,

177
00:07:54,700 --> 00:07:56,120
she slept with my father.

178
00:07:56,340 --> 00:07:57,860
My mother was so angry

179
00:07:57,860 --> 00:07:58,780
that she died in childbirth.

180
00:08:03,820 --> 00:08:04,620
What a pity.

181
00:08:06,900 --> 00:08:07,720
In this world,

182
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:08,980
I'm the only one

183
00:08:10,700 --> 00:08:11,760
who remembers my mother.

184
00:08:16,660 --> 00:08:17,400
Your mother

185
00:08:17,960 --> 00:08:19,720
wouldn't want to see you like this.

186
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:27,160
Easy for you to say.

187
00:08:32,560 --> 00:08:33,540
And his son

188
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,940
shouldn't let the man who killed him

189
00:08:36,400 --> 00:08:37,980
prosper.

190
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:39,380
How can you repay a kindness

191
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:40,680
if you repay evil with kindness?

192
00:08:41,260 --> 00:08:43,060
There are only so many resources in this world.

193
00:08:43,880 --> 00:08:44,720
Some gain,

194
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:46,400
some lose.

195
00:08:47,680 --> 00:08:48,540
I don't want to lose.

196
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:51,220
If you want something,

197
00:08:51,940 --> 00:08:53,320
you have to fight for it.

198
00:08:54,680 --> 00:08:55,900
I want Yang City,

199
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:57,980
and you.

200
00:08:58,780 --> 00:09:00,380
I have to do something big.

201
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:03,720
You're crazy.

202
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:08,060
As long as you announce in the newspaper

203
00:09:08,640 --> 00:09:10,180
to break off with Ling Shenxing,

204
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:12,140
and marry me,

205
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:14,580
I'll immediately announce

206
00:09:14,740 --> 00:09:16,140
the prescription for the plague,

207
00:09:16,520 --> 00:09:17,800
bringing peace to Yang City.

208
00:09:19,540 --> 00:09:20,120
How does that sound?

209
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:21,800
Isn't this deal

210
00:09:22,140 --> 00:09:22,720
quite favorable?

211
00:09:23,760 --> 00:09:24,980
You really caused the plague?

212
00:09:26,220 --> 00:09:28,020
You're so heartless,

213
00:09:28,020 --> 00:09:28,340
you...

214
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:30,880
A man who doesn't look out for himself

215
00:09:30,900 --> 00:09:32,040
will be doomed.

216
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:34,740
I'm just doing my job.

217
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:35,980
Nonsense!

218
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:37,680
The saying

219
00:09:38,040 --> 00:09:39,060
means

220
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:40,680
if people don't cultivate their morality,

221
00:09:41,380 --> 00:09:42,980
they will be punished by heaven.

222
00:09:43,060 --> 00:09:43,880
It's not an excuse

223
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:45,860
for selfishness and profit!

224
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:50,240
[I like your fierce]

225
00:09:51,660 --> 00:09:52,780
[and hot temper.]

226
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:55,040
What should I do?

227
00:10:04,320 --> 00:10:05,600
Do you remember this sachet?

228
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:07,560
This is

229
00:10:08,380 --> 00:10:09,720
the gift you gave to Commander Ling.

230
00:10:12,900 --> 00:10:14,660
I could catch Ling Shenxing's flaw

231
00:10:15,640 --> 00:10:16,920
thanks to your help.

232
00:10:18,560 --> 00:10:19,500
You are very smart.

233
00:10:19,880 --> 00:10:21,740
You know to replace the things in this sachet.

234
00:10:22,680 --> 00:10:23,680
But unfortunately,

235
00:10:24,820 --> 00:10:26,160
you missed a detail.

236
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:28,980
The real problem

237
00:10:31,280 --> 00:10:32,440
is this rope.

238
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:34,640
This rope?

239
00:10:34,920 --> 00:10:36,080
It was soaked in a special solution

240
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:37,640
for 49 days.

241
00:10:38,640 --> 00:10:39,520
My family

242
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:41,420
is familiar with it.

243
00:10:42,020 --> 00:10:43,320
As long as you follow this scent,

244
00:10:44,860 --> 00:10:45,920
you'll naturally find

245
00:10:45,920 --> 00:10:47,040
the person you want.

246
00:10:48,800 --> 00:10:49,520
Crazy man!

247
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:57,720
You've set up such a big trap.

248
00:10:58,320 --> 00:10:59,000
what do you want?

249
00:11:01,520 --> 00:11:03,040
I just want you to hear

250
00:11:08,040 --> 00:11:09,100
the sound

251
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:11,120
of this gun

252
00:11:12,380 --> 00:11:13,400
shooting Ling Shenxing.

253
00:11:19,160 --> 00:11:20,200
You won't win.

254
00:11:21,340 --> 00:11:22,220
I will die

255
00:11:22,220 --> 00:11:22,880
in front of you

256
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:25,860
so you can never have me.

257
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:41,220
What did you put in the incense?

258
00:11:47,580 --> 00:11:48,140
Smart.

259
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:50,300
I put Tendon-Softening Powder

260
00:11:50,300 --> 00:11:50,900
in the incense.

261
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:52,780
But don't worry,

262
00:11:53,420 --> 00:11:54,400
it won't kill you.

263
00:11:55,060 --> 00:11:56,480
It just makes you temporarily powerless.

264
00:11:57,300 --> 00:11:58,480
As long as you behave,

265
00:11:59,240 --> 00:12:00,920
I'll make you happy for life.

266
00:12:06,380 --> 00:12:07,140
Help me!

267
00:12:08,020 --> 00:12:09,080
Shenxing!

268
00:12:09,840 --> 00:12:10,660
It's too late.

269
00:12:13,540 --> 00:12:15,420
The moment you walked in,

270
00:12:17,080 --> 00:12:18,740
I had your divorce papers

271
00:12:18,740 --> 00:12:19,680
with Ling Shenxing

272
00:12:20,560 --> 00:12:22,320
published in all the newspapers.

273
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:25,320
Now everyone in Yang City knows

274
00:12:26,500 --> 00:12:27,060
that

275
00:12:28,180 --> 00:12:29,300
you, Su Muwan,

276
00:12:30,180 --> 00:12:31,320
and Ling Shenxing

277
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:32,660
are no longer related.
